ible builds\n- Update Dockerfile to use uv via multi-stage copy (Python 3.13)\n- Update justfile commands: sync/sync-prod/add/add-dev/remove\n- Fix pre-existing bugs: just ruff \u2192 just lint, Python version inconsistencies\n- Add uv ecosystem to dependabot, toml section to editorconfig\n- Update all documentation (CLAUDE.md, TEMPLATE_CLAUDE.md, README.md)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-19T17:03:45Z", "repo": "python-project-template", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f3c876a6a204d9add66b9843b62866ecb95a5004", "message": "Merge pull request #46 from talgat-abdraimov/feature/http-client\n\nadded base http client", "created_at": "2025-11-16T12:59:46Z", "repo": "python-project-template", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5ba69909c9767d2056860d68789fab48bc2aae43", "message": "added base http client", "created_at": "2025-11-16T12:59:28Z", "repo": "python-project-template", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "52176d7e91803c06c923b85d4e57d1a2900d06e8", "message": "Merge pull request #45 from talgat-abdraimov/feature/claude-instruction\n\nremoved branch protection job", "created_at": "2025-11-03T08:52:02Z", "repo": "python-project-template", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "be5b8097069dcc77b194cf51004888d4135c2d74", "message": "removed branch protection job", "created_at": "2025-11-03T08:51:11Z", "repo": "python-project-template", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8e3038960918403a700059939a51aff71fcd1b3e", "message": "Merge pull request #44 from talgat-abdraimov/feature/claude-instruction\n\nRename CLAUDE.md to TEMPLATE_CLAUDE.md and add branch protection", "created_at": "2025-11-03T08:46:29Z", "repo": "python-project-template", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {